{"id":"en_medal-for-a-new-recruit","title":"Medal for a New Recruit","titleEn":"Medal for a New Recruit","description":"Alexander Bennett, a fresh recruit, springs into action when a bus plunges into a river, rescuing passengers and triggering the Super Soldier System, which grants him a \"Dragon in Water\" ability. His remarkable performance in live-fire exercises allows him to bring down an enemy reconnaissance aircraft through \"ballistic calibration,\" guaranteeing his fellow soldiers a spot in the unit. For his courage, he is awarded a First-Class Merit, capturing the true essence of military valor.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/5f7ada146629cc2c/zh_TW/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/5f7ada146629cc2c/zh_TW/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["System","System","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9kgk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_medal-for-a-new-recruit_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9kgk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_medal-for-a-new-recruit_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9kgk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_medal-for-a-new-recruit_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9kgk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_medal-for-a-new-recruit_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9kgk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_medal-for-a-new-recruit_5","